{%- set dropped_switches = switches[2:] -%}
{#- LINK ROLES (2026-09-21, framework discovery). The frame binds one link per ROLE the case
    needs, and finds each link through the framework, never through a declaration:
      tb      `dut.portA <-> tb.ethA`            the far end is the TestBox        REQUIRED
      copper  `dut.portPeer <-> peer.portDut`     a fixed twisted-pair partner port REQUIRED
      fibre   `dut.portFibre <-> fibre_peer.portFibre`   a fitted fibre module     optional
